{"4027240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Plants", "steam_appid": 4027240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af0b1bb190e61bcda7c478e83077e151.avif?t=1777950788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras_big/af0b1bb190e61bcda7c478e83077e151.webp?t=1777950788 width=1560 height=119 /></span>Grow and command a tiny army of plants to defend the last sapling from the invading Fungi Nation. If the sapling falls, your run ends—start over with nothing and learn from your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af4cad8b5fa60d3f7464d4c7beafa62d.poster.avif?t=1777950788\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af4cad8b5fa60d3f7464d4c7beafa62d.webm?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af4cad8b5fa60d3f7464d4c7beafa62d.mp4?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preparation Phase</strong><br>Plant your units, build defenses, and organize your strategy. The first plant you place becomes <strong>The King</strong>—if it falls, the level is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack Phase</strong><br>Night falls. Take control of your plants, issue commands, and fight off waves of invading fungi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat &amp; Survive</strong><br>When the sun rises, reorganize and prepare again. All plants and structures are restored—but the sapling’s health carries over between levels. Protect it at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/88cbf2c87b711c5ca3c96fa1572ce932.avif?t=1777950788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras_big/88cbf2c87b711c5ca3c96fa1572ce932.webp?t=1777950788 width=1560 height=119 /></span>Unlock up to <strong>24 unique plants</strong>, each with their own passive ability that can completely change your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your army, experiment with combinations, and discover powerful synergies to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/dbdcd9dc716f08b689e05e8649b15221.poster.avif?t=1777950788\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/dbdcd9dc716f08b689e05e8649b15221.webm?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/dbdcd9dc716f08b689e05e8649b15221.mp4?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plant Roles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plant falls into one of 4 roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage Dealer</strong><br>High damage plants built to eliminate enemies quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defender</strong><br>Frontline units that absorb damage and protect your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong><br>Boost nearby plants with powerful buffs and utility effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Producer</strong><br>Generate extra currency between waves to grow your army faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/4bb2bfb3903e6b391bc3337d72550188.avif?t=1777950788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras_big/4bb2bfb3903e6b391bc3337d72550188.webp?t=1777950788 width=1560 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your strategy and grow stronger every run with powerful upgrades and unique loadouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/96a49a97de162c174d4b3e242231d145.poster.avif?t=1777950788\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/96a49a97de162c174d4b3e242231d145.webm?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/96a49a97de162c174d4b3e242231d145.mp4?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tiny Weapons:</strong> Choose from <strong>12 unique weapons</strong>, each offering a different playstyle. No weapon is strictly stronger—equip your plants to match your strategy and build the perfect army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks:</strong> Level up by killing enemies and rack up your experience points to then spend them on perks, there are over 15 different perks that you can choose from, ranging from common which buffs basics stats, epics that shake up gameplay in the levels, and legendary that grants you extra passive and active abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King Abilities:</strong> Empower your King with over <strong>20 unique abilities</strong>. Equip up to 3 at a time, discover powerful synergies, and take control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Structures:</strong> On every section, there will be unique structures that you can place to increase your defense, such as walls or turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/12497da095c39e3ff27d3585c3e47e71.avif?t=1777950788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras_big/12497da095c39e3ff27d3585c3e47e71.webp?t=1777950788 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world divided into distinct sections, each with its own levels, challenges, and growing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through sections at your own pace—each one increases in difficulty and introduces new mechanics to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/344982bc6568c490fd2c66f563209190.poster.avif?t=1777950788\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/344982bc6568c490fd2c66f563209190.webm?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/344982bc6568c490fd2c66f563209190.mp4?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding Challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every section features unique levels with escalating difficulty.<br>Push further, face tougher encounters, and test your strategy against new conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fungi Nation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of enemies, each with their own abilities and behaviors.<br>Every section introduces new threats, forcing you to adapt and rethink your strategy to survive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af0b1bb190e61bcda7c478e83077e151.avif?t=1777950788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras_big/af0b1bb190e61bcda7c478e83077e151.webp?t=1777950788 width=1560 height=119 /></span>Grow and command a tiny army of plants to defend the last sapling from the invading Fungi Nation. If the sapling falls, your run ends—start over with nothing and learn from your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af4cad8b5fa60d3f7464d4c7beafa62d.poster.avif?t=1777950788\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af4cad8b5fa60d3f7464d4c7beafa62d.webm?t=1777950788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027240/extras/af4cad8b5fa60d3f7464d4